{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-heb-1-intro","title":"Hebrews 1 — Chapter Introduction","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":0,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":0},"content":"<p>with me. Ro 16:21-24 Greet. Ro 16:1-20 love. Ga 5:6; Eph 6:23; 1Ti 1:5; Phm 1:5; 2Jo 1:1,2; 3Jo 1:1 Grace. 1Co 16:23; Eph 6:24; 2Ti 4:22; Heb 13:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-1-1","title":"Hebrews 1:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 Christ in these last times coming to us from the Father, 4 is preferred above the angels, both in person and office.</p>\n<p>at. Ge 3:15; 6:3,13-22; 8:15-19; 9:1-17; 12:1-3; 26:2-5; 28:12-15 Ge 32:24-30; 46:2-4; Ex 3:1-22; Lu 24:27,44; Ac 28:23; 1Pe 1:10-12 2Pe 1:20,21 in. Nu 12:6-8; Joe 2:28 the fathers. Lu 1:55,72; Joh 7:22; Ac 13:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-1-2","title":"Hebrews 1:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>these. Ge 49:1; Nu 24:14; De 4:30; 18:15; 31:29; Isa 2:2; Jer 30:24; 48:47 Eze 38:16; Da 2:28; 10:14; Ho 3:5; Mic 4:1; Ac 2:17; Ga 4:4; Eph 1:10 2Pe 3:3; Jude 1:18 spoken. 5,8; 2:3; 5:8; 7:3; Mt 3:17; 17:5; 26:63; Mr 1:1; 12:6; Joh 1:14,17,18 Joh 3:16; 15:15; Ro 1:4 appointed. 2:8,9; Ps 2:6-9; Isa 9:6,7; 53:10-12; Mt 21:38; 28:18; Joh 3:25; 13:3 Joh 16:15; 17:2; Ac 10:36; Ro 8:17; 1Co 8:6; 15:25-27; Eph 1:20-23 Php 2:9-11; Col 1:17,18 by whom. Pr 8:22-31; Isa 44:24; 45:12,18; Joh 1:3; 1Co 8:6; Eph 3:9 Col 1:16,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-1-3","title":"Hebrews 1:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>the brightness. Joh 1:14; 14:9,10; 2Co 4:6 image. 2Co 4:4; Col 1:15,16 upholding. Ps 75:3; Joh 1:4; Col 1:17; Re 4:11 the word. Ec 8:4; Ro 1:16; 2Co 4:7 by himself. 7:27; 9:12-14,16,26; Joh 1:29; 1Jo 1:7; 3:5 sat. 4:14; 8:1; 10:12; 12:2; Ps 110:1; Mt 22:24; Mr 16:19; Lu 20:42,43 Ac 2:33; 7:56; Ro 8:34; Eph 1:20-22; Col 3:1; 1Pe 1:21; 3:22; Re 3:21 Majesty. 1Ch 29:11; Job 37:22; Mic 5:4; 2Pe 1:16; Jude 1:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-1-4","title":"Hebrews 1:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>so. 9; 2:9; Eph 1:21; Col 1:18; 2:10; 2Th 1:7; 1Pe 3:22; Re 5:11,12 by. Ps 2:7,8; Php 2:9-11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-1-5","title":"Hebrews 1:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>Thou. 5:5; Ps 2:7; Ac 13:33 I will. 2Sa 7:14; 1Ch 17:13; 22:10; 28:6; Ps 89:26,27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-1-6","title":"Hebrews 1:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>And again, etc. or, When he bringeth again. the first-begotten. 5; Pr 8:24,25; Joh 1:14,18; 3:16; Ro 8:29; Col 1:15,18; 1Jo 4:9 Re 1:5 And let. De 32:43; *Sept: Ps 97:7; Lu 2:9-14; 1Pe 3:22; Re 5:9-12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-1-7","title":"Hebrews 1:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>of. Gr. unto. Who. 14; 2Ki 2:11; 6:17; Ps 104:4; Isa 6:2; *Heb: Eze 1:13,14; Da 7:10; Zec 6:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-1-8","title":"Hebrews 1:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Thy throne. Ps 45:6,7 O God. 3:3,4; Isa 7:14; 9:6,7; 45:21,22,25; Jer 23:6; Ho 1:7; Zec 13:9 Mal 3:1; Mt 1:23; Lu 1:16,17; Joh 10:30,33; 20:28; Ro 9:5; 1Ti 3:16 Tit 2:13,14; 1Jo 5:20 for. Ps 145:13; Isa 9:7; De 2:37; 7:14; 1Co 15:25; 2Pe 1:11 a sceptre. 2Sa 23:3; Ps 72:1-4,7,11-14; 99:4; Isa 9:7; 32:1,2; Jer 23:5; 38:15 Zec 9:9 righteousness. Gr. rightness. or, straightness.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-1-9","title":"Hebrews 1:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>loved. 7:26; Ps 11:5; 33:5; 37:28; 40:8; 45:7; Isa 61:8 hated. Ps 119:104,128; Pr 8:13; Am 5:15; Zec 8:17; Ro 12:9; Re 2:6,7,15 thy God. Ps 89:26; Joh 20:17; 2Co 11:31; Eph 1:3; 1Pe 1:3 anointed. Ps 2:2,6; *marg: Ps 89:20; Isa 61:1; Lu 4:18; Joh 1:41; 3:34; Ac 4:27; 10:38 oil. Ps 23:5; Isa 61:3; Ro 15:13; Ga 5:22 thy fellows. 2:11; 1Co 1:9; 1Jo 1:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-1-10","title":"Hebrews 1:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>Thou. Ps 102:25-27 in. Ge 1:1; Joh 1:1-3; Re 3:14 hast. Pr 8:29; Isa 42:5; 48:13; 51:13; Jer 32:17; Zec 12:1 the works. De 4:19; Ps 8:3,4; 19:1; Isa 64:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-1-11","title":"Hebrews 1:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>shall perish. 12:27; Isa 34:4; 65:17; Mt 24:35; Mr 13:31; Lu 21:33; 2Pe 3:7-10 Re 20:11; 21:1 thou. Ps 10:16; 29:10; 90:2; Isa 41:4; 44:6; Re 1:11,17,18; 2:8 shall wax. Isa 50:9; 51:6,8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-1-12","title":"Hebrews 1:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>but. 13:8; Ex 3:14; Joh 8:58; Jas 1:17 and thy. Ps 90:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-1-13","title":"Hebrews 1:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>to. 5 Sit. 3; 10:12; Ps 110:1; Mt 22:44; Mr 12:36; Lu 20:42; Ac 2:34-36; 7:55 until. Ps 21:8,9; 132:18; Isa 63:3-6; Lu 19:27; 1Co 15:25,26; Re 19:11-21 Re 20:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-heb-1-14","title":"Hebrews 1:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"HEB","chapterStart":1,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":1,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>ministering. 8:6; 10:11; Ps 103:20,21; Da 3:28; 7:10; Mt 18:10; Lu 1:19,23; 2:9,13 Ac 13:2; Ro 13:6; 15:16,27; 2Co 9:12; Php 2:17,25; *Gr: 1Ki 22:19; Job 1:6; Ps 103:20,21; 104:4; Isa 6:2,3; Da 7:10 Mt 13:41,49,50; Lu 1:19; 2Th 1:7; Jude 1:14 sent. Ge 19:15,16; 32:1,2,24; Ac 11:22; 1Pe 1:12; Re 5:6 minister. Ps 34:7; 91:11,12; Da 6:22; 9:21-23; 10:11,12; Mt 1:20; 2:13; 24:31 Lu 16:22; Ac 5:19; 10:3,4; 12:7,23; 16:26; 27:23 heirs. 6:12,17; Mt 25:34; Ro 8:17; Ga 3:7,9,29; Eph 3:6; Tit 3:7; Jas 2:5 1Pe 1:4; 3:7</p>"}]}